## Managed by Ansible (role: postgres).
##
## Maps the OS user PgBouncer's own shipped systemd unit runs as to the
## pgbouncer_auth role. Debian's/PGDG's pgbouncer.service hardcodes
## `User=postgres` (confirmed against a live package install -- there is no
## separate "pgbouncer" system account), so that is the only OS identity
## this map admits. pg_hba.conf's `local ... pgbouncer_auth peer
## map=pgbouncer_auth_map` line is the only place this map is used.
pgbouncer_auth_map postgres pgbouncer_auth
